'''Apex Predator''' is an [[Achievement]] awarded to Carl for killing the very last hunter on the [[Sixth Floor]], thus fulfilling the promise he made to the hunters at the end of the [[Fifth Floor]].{{cite|4|34}}{{cite|6|2}}

